{
  "_readme": [
    "Upstream MCP servers behind the gateway. Bundled into the Worker at deploy (no size limit).",
    "Key = URL path segment (/<key>/mcp). readTools = EXACT tool names a read-only user may call; anything else is hidden and refused.",
    "roles = Entra app role(s) required for this server, in addition to MCP.ReadOnly / MCP.Admin.",
    "allowWrite stays false for third-party chatbots. Raw escape-hatch tools (*_api_get, graph_raw_request) and tools that can return stored secrets are never listed.",
    "Change this file and push to main: GitHub Actions deploys it (.github/workflows/deploy.yml). Never deploy from a local copy that is not on GitHub."
  ],
